<style>[data-pf-type=Paragraph3] a{color:#ce181e!important;text-decoration:none!important}[data-pf-type=Paragraph3] a:hover{text-decoration:underline!important}</style><div data-pf-editor-version="legacy" class="sc-fAGzVM ckdstx __pf __pf_fMR8hmyh" id="__pf"><div data-pf-type="Body" class="sc-iowYbt LsuWb pf-4_"><div data-pf-type="Layout" class="sc-cTTcKX dkCVVW pf-5_"><div data-section-id="pf-3112" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-6_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-djTQOc ejtSSi"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-7_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-8_"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-9_ pf-heading-5-h1">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h1><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-11_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We pride ourselves on being the one-stop-shop for landowners and professional landscapers in the Midwest! Thanks to our strong relationships with top-rated brands, we are able to carry the widest selection of equipment at the lowest possible prices. We are here to assist you however we can, so if you have an inquiry that isn't on our list of Frequently Asked Questions, contact a Russo representative for more information.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-ca76" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-pKreJ kztRcD pf-13_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-djTQOc ejtSSi"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-14_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-15_"><div data-pf-type="Tabs" class="sc-eSfNPg eWfmip pf-16_"><div data-pf-type="TabsMenu" class="sc-bXWofN hksSLG pf-17_"><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="true" class="sc-cRmpXP gdrBnW pf-18_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">General</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-cRmpXP gdrBnW pf-20_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Finance</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-cRmpXP gdrBnW pf-22_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Online Orders</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-cRmpXP gdrBnW pf-24_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Service</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-cRmpXP gdrBnW pf-26_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Parts</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-cRmpXP gdrBnW pf-28_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Salt</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-cRmpXP gdrBnW pf-30_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Plant Health Care</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-cRmpXP gdrBnW pf-32_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Arbor</button></div><div data-pf-type="TabContentWrapper" class="sc-fLvPHi geLHnn pf-34_"><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:block" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-dUWExc QcfUZ pf-35_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-36_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-37_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-38_ pf-heading-7-h3">General Questions:</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-40_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What hours are your stores open?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-42_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Our store hours are generally Monday thru Friday: 7 am - 4 pm CST; Saturday: 7 am - 12 pm CST; Sunday: Closed. For the most up-to-date store hours including holiday hours and time zone changes, please select your local store on our store locator page here: <a href="/pages/storelocator" target="_self">Russo Locations</a>.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-44_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What does OPE stand for?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-46_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">OPE is short for Outdoor Power Equipment. Outdoor Power Equipment is machinery operated by an engine or electric power and used to maintain commercial, public, and residential lawns and gardens or used in landscape, turf, golf course, green nursery, forestry, or tree maintenance.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-48_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What are the product categories that Russo sells?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-50_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We sell a variety of landscaping and snow removal equipment and supplies that will meet your needs no matter what season it is! Shop our selection of Power Equipment, Parts, Winter Goods, Arbor, Turf, Supplies &amp; Tools, Trailers, Vehicles &amp; Tractors, and Used Equipment.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-52_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Can I demo equipment before buying?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-54_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, you can! We have a dedicated demo team that will bring equipment right to your crew so you can test in any environment you want. Please fill out the <a href="/pages/request-demo" target="_self">request a demo</a> form to get started!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-56_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you offer delivery or buy online pick up in-store?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-58_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We do! Some restrictions apply, so please ask when placing your order.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-60_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Can I text my sales rep?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-62_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, we can communicate through texting! Click the red "Text us!" button at the bottom right hand of the page to get started.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-64_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How can I contact Russo? Who can I talk to if I have other questions?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-66_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you still have more questions, feel free to visit our <a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact page</a> and get all your questions answered!</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-dUWExc QcfUZ pf-68_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-69_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-70_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-71_ pf-heading-7-h3">Finance Questions:</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-73_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How do I get a copy of an invoice or a statement?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-75_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Reach out to our finance team at <first-sel><a href="mailto:accounting@russopower.com">accounting@russopower.com</a></first-sel> and they can provide any information needed.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-77_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Who do I call if I need to make a change to my account?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-79_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Call 847-233-7834 and ask for accounts receivable. They will be able to help update any information!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-81_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What form of payment is accepted?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-83_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We accept payment of cash, check, any major credit card, ACH, and several outsource financing options.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-85_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Can I make a payment online?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-87_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We offer payment links for all open invoices. Contact your local sales rep for more information.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-89_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you offer financing on mowers and large equipment?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-91_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, we do! We offer several <a href="/pages/financing" target="_self">finance options</a> for commercial loans and leases, including but not limited to, Yard Card, Sheffield, Synchrony, Western Equipment Finance, Kubota Financing, and Avant Techno Finance.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-93_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How do I fill out a credit application?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-95_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Any and all of our locations can assist you with filling out a credit application in person.<br>Some financing options allow you to remain in the comfort of your own home while filling out a credit application like Yard Card or Sheffield Financial.
</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-97_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Who can I talk to if I have other finance questions?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-99_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you still have more questions, feel free to visit our <a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact page</a> and get all your questions answered!</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-dUWExc QcfUZ pf-101_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-102_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-103_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-104_ pf-heading-7-h3">RussoPower.com Online Order Questions:</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-106_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What is my order status?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-108_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Check your email for your tracking number. You can also look under My Orders when signed into your account on our website.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-110_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">When will I receive my order?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-112_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">All in-stock items will be delivered in 2-3 business days. Special order items have an 8-15 day lead time.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-114_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What is your return policy?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-116_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We will not accept a return without a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA). Please email us at <a href="mailto:russo@russopower.com">russo@russopower.com</a> to obtain an RMA number and shipping instructions. You will receive credit back in the same manner you first paid within 5 business days of us receiving the returned item.
<br>Please read our full <a href="/pages/return-policy" target="_self">return policy</a> to see if your purchase will qualify as returnable.
</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-118_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Does Russo provide the shipping label for a return?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-120_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, we do! Please email <second-sel><a href="mailto:russo@russopower.com">russo@russopower.com</a></second-sel>.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-122_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">When my order is shipped or ready to be picked up, will I receive notification emails?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-124_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, you will! If you do not automatically receive one, please email <second-sel><a href="mailto:russo@russopower.com">russo@russopower.com</a></second-sel>.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-126_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How do I cancel my order?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-128_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If your order has not yet shipped, please email <a href="mailto:russo@russpower.com">russo@russpower.com</a> or call 224-268-3037. Note: we cannot guarantee cancellation.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-130_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How do I make a tax-exempt purchase?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-132_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Please email your Tax-Exempt documents to <a href="mailto:finance@russopower.com">finance@russopower.com</a>.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-134_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you ship outside the United States?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-136_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">No, we only ship within the US.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-138_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do I need to create an account before ordering online?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-140_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">No, guest checkout is available when ordering online. However, benefits of creating account with us include: faster checkout on future purchases, order tracking, and purchase history to name a few.<br></p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-142_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">I’m having trouble placing my order, who do I contact?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-144_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"> RussoPower.com Customer Service can be reached via email at&nbsp;<second-sel><a href="mailto:russo@russopower.com">russo@russopower.com</a></second-sel> or via text at 224-268-3037.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-146_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Why is my payment getting declined?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-148_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Please make sure the billing address that you entered matches the credit card you are using. If troubles persist, email <first-sel><a href="mailto:russo@russopower.com">russo@russopower.com</a></first-sel> or text 224-268-3037.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-150_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Who can I talk to if I have other online order questions?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-152_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you still have more questions, feel free to visit our <a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact page</a> and get all your questions answered!</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-dUWExc QcfUZ pf-154_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-155_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-156_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-157_ pf-heading-7-h3">Service Questions:</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-159_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">When servicing my equipment, do you offer pick-up and drop-off for my machine?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-161_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, we charge $40 for pick up and another $40 to drop off equipment within a 20-mile radius of our locations. Extra fees apply for anything beyond 20 miles.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-163_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Is there a diagnostic charge just to look at my machine?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-165_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, there is a diagnostic fee for all equipment:
<br>- For small to medium landscape equipment, a charge worth .5 hrs of labor is applied.
<br>- For large tractors, RTVs, utility loaders, and truck &amp; trailer equipment, a charge worth 1.0 hrs of labor is applied.
</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-167_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How long will it take for my machine to be diagnosed &amp; repaired?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-169_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Wait times can vary depending on the time of year and product availability. Please call ahead to inquire about our lead times.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-171_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you service all outdoor power equipment?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-173_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We only service the brands we support. Please call ahead if you are unsure of the machine in need of service.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-175_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Can I wait for repairs?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-177_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">You cannot wait for repairs. (Unless it's something quick like sharpening or replacing a single mower blade or replacing an entire wheel assembly.)</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-179_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Can I get a loaner?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-181_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The short answer is it depends on your warranty status.
Loaners are provided during the 1st year if the repair is covered by warranty and the repairs will take longer than 48 hours.
You can receive discounted rentals for 1+ years if under warranty.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-183_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do I need an appointment?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-185_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">For equipment, we use a "1st come, 1st service" system; there are no appointments.
<br>For trailers, spreaders, and plows, call ahead to make an appointment or submit a <a href="/pages/service-department" target="_self">Service Request Form</a>.
</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-187_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Who can I talk to if I have other service questions?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-189_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you still have more questions, feel free to visit our <a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact page</a> and get all your questions answered!</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-dUWExc QcfUZ pf-191_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-192_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-193_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-194_ pf-heading-7-h3">Parts&nbsp;Questions:</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-196_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What kinds of parts do you carry?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-198_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We carry over one million parts for all types of outdoor power equipment including engines, air filters, belts, batteries, spark plugs, trimmer line, blades, maintenance kits, and so much more. We do not list every part that we carry on our website. If you don't see what you're looking for online, call or text an in-store rep.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-200_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How do I find the right part to fix my equipment?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-202_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you know what you need but don't know the SKU number, use a <a href="/pages/parts-finder" target="_self">parts finder search</a> to find the exact part number you need.
<br>If you don't know exactly which part is needed, our parts specialists are here to help! Have the year, make, and model of your equipment available as well as any serial and model number information you can find.
</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-204_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you don't have the part that I need, can you order it?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-206_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We can special order almost anything. Let's work together to find the part that you need!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-208_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you carry more parts than what is displayed on your website?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-210_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes! Each location features an extensive parts department that features different items, so if you can’t find what you’re looking for on our website, visit one of our stores and we’ll do everything we can to help you. Check out our <a href="/pages/storelocator" target="_self">store locator</a> to find your nearest Russo location!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-212_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If I'm not sure which part needs to be replaced, can you help me figure it out?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-214_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If your equipment isn't working properly, but you don’t know the cause, our knowledgeable <a href="/pages/service-department" target="_self">service specialists</a> can take a look. Call our service department to schedule a diagnostic appointment. With a diagnosis, you'll be able to decide if you'd like our service department to fix it or order parts and fix it yourself.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-216_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Who can I talk to if I have specific questions about parts?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-218_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you still have more questions, feel free to visit our <a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact page</a> and get all your questions answered!</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-dUWExc QcfUZ pf-220_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-221_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-222_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-223_ pf-heading-7-h3">Salt Supply Questions:</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-225_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Where can I buy salt &amp; de-icer?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-227_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">You can browse our variety of salt and de-icer <a href="/pages/storelocator" target="_self">in-store</a> and <a href="/collections/ice-melts" target="_self">online</a>.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-229_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What kinds of salt &amp; ice melt do you carry?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-231_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We have a wide selection of de-icing solutions to fit most needs. With rock salt, liquid power melt, and other options, Russo has you covered. Whether you need ice melt by the bag, pallet, or truckload, you’ll be ready to tackle whatever winter has in store for you. To learn more, visit our <a href="/pages/russo-salt-supply" target="_self">Russo Salt Supply</a> resource page.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-233_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What is the difference between salt and de-icer?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-235_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The term de-icer fully encompasses the entire umbrella of ice melt solutions, and salt is just one of the solutions that can be used when ice is present. Salt is classified as a de-icer, but there are other solid and liquid products that can be used to better handle each task at hand. To learn more about which ice melt is right for you, visit our <a href="/pages/russo-salt-supply" target="_self">de-icer</a> resource page.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-237_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What is the best salt or ice melt for me?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-239_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Although most ice melt solutions can work for many scenarios, there are specific products that will work best in different situations. Learn which <a href="/pages/russo-salt-supply#packaged.deicer" target="_self">de-icer</a> is best for your specific circumstance!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-241_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">When should I apply salt or de-icer?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-243_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">De-icer should be applied differently based on the weather. Depending on how wet or dense the snow is, applying ice melt at different times can optimize the products’ performance. For more information, reach out to one of our in-store salt supply specialists.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-245_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How should I apply my salt or ice melt?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-247_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Depending on your specific needs, de-icers can be applied in many different ways. Whether you are applying by hand, using walk-behind or truck-mounted spreaders, or other equipment, we have everything you need to get the job done quickly and efficiently. Shop all <a href="/collections/winter-goods" target="_self">winter goods</a> to find the right equipment for the task at hand.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-249_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Who can I talk to if I have specific questions about salt or de-icer?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-251_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you still have more questions, feel free to visit our <a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact page</a> and get all your questions answered!</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-dUWExc QcfUZ pf-253_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-254_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-255_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-256_ pf-heading-7-h3">Plant Health Care Questions:</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-258_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What kinds of plant health care products do you sell?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-260_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We carry an array of plant health care products including equipment, fertilizer, fungicides, insecticides, peat moss, turf &amp; tree control, weed &amp; grass control, and more to fulfill all of your landscaping needs. Browse our <a href="/collections/turf" target="_self">turf supply products</a>.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-262_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">When is the right time to apply different lawn care products?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-264_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Many different factors go into lawn care product application timing, especially the time of year, which is why we came up with a 5-step lawn program to help guide you through the changing seasons. Take a look at the <a href="/pages/5-step-lawn-program" target="_self">5-step lawn program</a>, or talk to a PHC expert today!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-266_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How should I apply lawn care products?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-268_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Depending on what kind of product you need to apply, you may require different pieces of equipment. We carry a selection of spreaders and sprayers, including handheld, walk-behind, and stand on, so visit one of our <a href="/pages/storelocator" target="_self">locations</a>&nbsp;or look at our <a href="/collections/turf" target="_self">products</a> to find exactly what you’re looking for!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-270_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Are there different products that should be used for different types of lawns?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-272_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Just like people, different types of lawns may require different applications to truly bring out the best in them. Whether you know what kind of lawn you are working with or not, our turf supply specialists are here to help you figure out the best strategy to use to breathe new life into your lawns. Get in touch with a Russo PHC expert here: <a href="/pages/5-step-lawn-program#contact.form" target="_self">Russo 5-Step Lawn Program Contact Form.</a></p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-274_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you sell PHC products for professionals or homeowners?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-276_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">While we specialize in products for professionals, we do sell to homeowners as well! We carry varying sizes of different chemicals, fertilizer, and other applicants, so whether you’re buying for one lawn or one hundred, we have you covered!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-278_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you only sell lawn chemicals or do you sell lawn care equipment as well?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-280_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We carry both lawn care applicants like fertilizer, herbicides, insecticides, and more as well as equipment like spreaders, sprayers, aerators, power rakes, and more! Shop our <a href="/collections/turf" target="_self">turf supply products</a>.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-282_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Who can I talk to if I have specific questions about plant health care?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-284_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you still have more questions, feel free to visit our <a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact page</a> and get all your questions answered!</p></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:none" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-dUWExc QcfUZ pf-286_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-287_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-288_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-iLsJvT gbBbPZ pf-289_ pf-heading-7-h3">Arbor Questions:</h3><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-291_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">What kinds of Arbor equipment do you sell?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-293_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We carry an extensive amount of <a href="/collections/arbor" target="_self">arbor equipment</a> like rope, carabiners, accessories, pruning &amp; trimming tools, harnesses, pulleys, rigging, safety supplies, and much more. Learn more about our robust arbor department from our <a href="/pages/arbor-gear" target="_self">certified experts</a> on staff.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-295_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you sell Arbor products for professionals or hobbyists?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-297_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Whether trees are a passion, a profession, or a little bit of both, we carry equipment for all uses!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-299_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How do I figure out which arbor gear is right for me to use?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-301_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you’re unsure about which pieces of equipment or supplies you need to get your job done safely and accurately, ask one of our arbor specialists! Come into one of our stores or start the conversation through our texting chat box.</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-303_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Is there different equipment that should be used for different types of trees/jobs?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-305_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">As for many jobs, different equipment can be required for different tasks. Some tools can be a bit more versatile while others are designed for a specific purpose, so if you’re unsure, feel free to ask for the advice of one of our arbor experts!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-307_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Does arbor equipment wear out or get old? How often do I need to replace it?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-309_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Arbor equipment is often the difference between safe work and risky work. While there isn’t a normal expiration date on most items, they do get old, wear down, and can be less effective as time goes on. If you’re not sure if your equipment is still up to the correct standards, our knowledgeable in-house arborists are happy to help!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-311_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">How can I test my equipment to make sure that it's safe to use?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-313_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you want to make sure that you get trusted advice from an industry professional, we actually offer training demos at our Elgin location. During these seminars, certified experts will teach you about the basics of rope maintenance and safety. If you aren’t able to make it, though, simply reach out to any of our specialists and ask… we’re always here to help!</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-315_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you only sell arbor gear or do you sell arbor power equipment as well?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-317_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">In addition to gear, we sell everything from chainsaws and other pruning/trimming equipment to chemicals and everything in between! Explore our selection of <a href="/collections/arbor" target="_self">arbor equipment and supplies</a>.
</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-319_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Who can I talk to if I have specific questions about arbor?</p><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-321_ pf-text-3" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">If you still have more questions, feel free to visit our <a href="/pages/contact-us" target="_self">contact page</a> and get all your questions answered!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
